# Derived input for a model calculation; NOT a new experimental refinement.
# Source: Donnay G., Donnay J.D.H., Kullerud G. (1958), American Mineralogist
# 43, 228-242, Crystal and twin structure of digenite, Cu9S5.
# Coordinate transcription checked against COD 9000079 / AMCSD 0000082.
# Each inversion orbit is listed ONCE here. The downloaded COD file lists
# both +/- partners as independent rows and also supplies inversion symmetry.
# The angle below is the original 13 degrees 56 minutes, not rounded 13.93.
# No measured 4.2-5 K geometry or thermal displacement model is supplied.
